{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/662794-fettering-to-a-demon","id":662794,"title":"Fettering to a Demon","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-13T01:33:40-07:00","id":662794,"title":"Fettering to a Demon","content":"So the Hunted condition sends an angel of rank 4-5. Which means he can have an Influence of 4+, which allows to create Infrastructure on a target (Demon, for example). Now that Infrastructure is there, next thing to do is to Strengthen it to Open. And after that, you Fetter yourself to the Demon permanently. Three actions, all done from the safety of twilight and suddenly you're messing with a Demon just by your existence. You're always with him, so his Cover/covers are boned, you can read his mind and you can even Urge him to do stuff which messes with him even more. <br /> <br /> How can a demon protect himself from this? Yes, this does cost 7 Essence, but I think it's more than worth it from the Angel's perspective.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T06:29:11-07:00","id":663010,"title":"","content":"Frankly, once a Rank 4-5 know <i>exactly</i> who you are, you kind of have other concerns.<br /> <br /> Demons can suborn infrastructure. You made <i>it</i> Infrastructure somehow? They suborn it and thank you for the free Aether.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T08:11:21-07:00","id":663150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Griautis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/662794-fettering-to-a-demon#post662794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the Hunted condition sends an angel of rank 4-5. Which means he can have an Influence of 4+, which allows to create Infrastructure on a target (Demon, for example). Now that Infrastructure is there, next thing to do is to Strengthen it to Open. And after that, you Fetter yourself to the Demon permanently. Three actions, all done from the safety of twilight and suddenly you're messing with a Demon just by your existence. You're always with him, so his Cover/covers are boned, you can read his mind and you can even Urge him to do stuff which messes with him even more.<br /> <br /> How can a demon protect himself from this? Yes, this does cost 7 Essence, but I think it's more than worth it from the Angel's perspective.</div> </div> </div> </div> One? Don't get Hunted. If you've been compromised that badly, you likely need to ditch your Cover and run away. Being compromised like that is the Demon equivalent to hitting a vampire with a moltov, or a mage being heavily smacked with paradox. Its their weakness. This is a major, life-or-death situation. Impossible scenarios are the default here.<br /> <br /> Two, the angel using those powers is very likely to trigger a demon's aether senses. That's going to trigger a fight / flight responce right there, getting the hell out. Chase scene is going to be too busy for the angel to fetter the demon. If the demon isn't on the rapid look out for angels while carrying the Hunted Condition, he deserves what's coming to him. <br /> <br /> Three, Devour Infrastructure, or any of the other mess-with-Infrastruture powers demons get can work. <br /> <br /> Four, you're up against a Rank 4-5 angel. You're pretty much in trouble no matter what you do. An angel with a Numina similar to Echoing Death can effectively kill/recycle the demon with a single touch. Who needs to follow them around when a simple capture and integration into the Machine will yield all the informaiton the demon had?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T08:21:40-07:00","id":664331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/662794-fettering-to-a-demon?p=663150#post663150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who needs to follow them around when a simple capture and integration into the Machine will yield all the informaiton the demon had?</div> </div> </div> </div>Demons rarely work alone, and if you can get somebody on the inside, then you have dirt on all the demons you want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T08:35:00-07:00","id":664337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/662794-fettering-to-a-demon?p=664331#post664331\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demons rarely work alone, and if you can get somebody on the inside, then you have dirt on all the demons you want.</div> </div> </div> </div> I stand by my statement. You get inside his head, you can BECOME them. There's a reason that we have paranoia as a theme. You never really know if that person with Mrs. Wrench's face is actually the demon you've worked with for so many years. Could be an imposter. Or the demon has been reprocessed, but kept the Covers as angelic Infrastructure now. You're not just comporomised, you're now the enemy within demon ranks.<br /> <br /> Demon is a spy game for a reason, and there's a million ways for either side to spy on the other. You don't need a Fettered Rank 4 angel for that. <br /> <br /> If anything, the Fettering is dangerous for the angel, because that effectively limits their supply of essence. Yes, the 1/day essence drain is offset by the Fetter. But the angels need infusions of sacrifices to maintain high levels of essence to do things. If they're wandering away with a demon, they're not getting their sacrifices, and thus, their power is limited. Well, assuming they need to be in presence of sacrifice, I'm not sure on that one.<br /> <br /> Still, point remains. There is nothing that fettering will do that can't be done other ways, so if you've been that exposed, you're FUBAR.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 09-14-2015, 11:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T08:37:52-07:00","id":664343,"title":"","content":"That's something that comes up a lot in the Interface fiction anthology. Demons have allies but they're aware that being completely trusting is just asking for trouble. Mrs. Wrench disappears and you may regret telling her all about your covers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}